      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Seeded randomness\n\nUse the loop index as the seed of `random/uniform` and you get a stable scatter — same patch loaded later gives the same scatter. Change the seed input to reroll.\n\n80 ellipses placed at deterministic random (x, y).",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
